<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/industrial-iot">Industrial &amp; IoT</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Industrial IoT Devices</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Industrial &amp; IoT products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/industrial-iot/pcba-box-build" aria-label="PCBA &amp; Box Build"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">PB</span><span class="label">PCBA &amp; Box Build</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/industrial-iot/iot-device-assembly" aria-label="Industrial IoT Devices" aria-current="page"><span class="abbr" aria-hidden="true">ID</span><span class="label">Industrial IoT Devices</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the product does and where it runs and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Industrial &amp; IoT &middot; Industrial IoT Devices</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Industrial IoT devices, from PCBA to complete product</h1><p class="mk-lede">Connected-device manufacturing brings the PCBA, wireless module, antenna, sensors, battery and mechanical assembly together in one finished product. Hana supports this complete assembly process, from compact connected devices to LTE telematics units for remote asset monitoring, including functional and wireless test at finished-unit level.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-iot-device-assembly" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="/images/photos/mk-industrial-iot-card-iot-device.webp" alt="Connected IoT device on the line" style="width:100%;height:420px;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div></div></section><section id="specialize-iot-device-assembly" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Hana assembles connected devices from the populated board through to the finished, tested unit.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Complete connected devices</span></div><div class="desc">PCBA, wireless modules, sensors, battery and enclosure assembled and tested as one complete product.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Board, radio and antenna integration</span></div><div class="desc">PCBA with embedded wireless modules, antenna integration and sensor assembly within the same manufacturing program.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Enclosure, cable and harness assembly</span></div><div class="desc">Cable and harness assembly, enclosure fitting and final mechanical assembly around the completed board.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Wireless functional test</span></div><div class="desc">In-house test capability for 802.11 embedded wireless modules, GSM/cellular, GPS, Bluetooth and acoustic functions, selected according to program requirements.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">05</span><span class="t">Telematics and remote monitoring units</span></div><div class="desc">LTE cellular and GNSS telematics units with internal antennas, a backup battery and RS-232, RS-485, CAN and configurable I/O interfaces, built together with their wiring harnesses.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See PCBA &amp; Box Build for the wider manufacturing process, from SMT assembly through final product integration, configuration and packout.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build/box-build">Explore Box Build <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/koh-kong"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Cambodia</span></span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana assemble my whole IoT device, not just the PCB?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Box build covers the radio, sensors, battery, cable and harness, and the enclosure and mechanical parts around the board, assembled and functionally tested as one finished unit before it ships.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How can Hana test a wireless product before it ships?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana can test the finished device in-house for 802.11 wireless, GSM and cellular, GPS, Bluetooth and acoustic functions, with the test set selected according to program requirements.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana support a pilot build before volume production?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Pilot and pre-production builds can be run ahead of volume so the assembly sequence, fixtures and test coverage are proven on real units first.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana build cellular telematics and remote monitoring units?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana builds telematics units used to monitor power equipment at cell sites. Each unit combines an LTE cellular module, multi-constellation GNSS, internal antennas and a rechargeable backup battery with RS-232, RS-485, CAN and configurable I/O in a compact enclosure, and the wiring harnesses are built alongside. Cellular and GPS functional test can be run on the finished unit.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:32px;"><a href="/markets/industrial-iot" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Industrial &amp; IoT market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your connected-device program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>

